OL,3,GNorthern Ireland                       
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening 
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Then the rest of the      
OL,7,Fnight will be rather cloudy with the   
OL,8,Fchance of the odd shower, some clear   
OL,9,Fperiods in the north. Freshening       
OL,10,Fsoutheasterly wind.                    
OL,12,CSunday:FA dry day although still with  
OL,13,Fa fair amount of cloud at times, best  
OL,14,Fof the brightness in the northwest.    
OL,15,FFresh southeasterly wind.              
OL,17,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry   
OL,18,Fand breezy for most of Monday, chance  
OL,19,Fof rain later. Rain likely at times on 
OL,20,FTuesday and Wednesday.                 
